<div class="header-container">
  <header>
    <div class="header-content">
      <h1 class="page-title"><span>Genocide op Banda (1621)</span>
</h1>
              <div class="introtext">
                    <div class="field-field-introtext node-sourcebox-full__field-introtext">
              <div class="field-field-introtext-item node-sourcebox-full__field-introtext-item"><p>De bevolking van Banda wordt uitgemoord in opdracht van J.P. Coen </p></div>
        </div>

        </div>
          </div>
  </header>
            <div class="field-field-media-image node-sourcebox-full__field-media-image">
