<div data-history-node-id="6390" class="node-container row-inner">

  <article class="node">

    
    <div>
      
                <div class="field-field-paragraphs node-sourcebox-full__field-paragraphs">
              <div class="field-field-paragraphs-item node-sourcebox-full__field-paragraphs-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-collection paragraph--view-mode--default accordion-collection no-main-title" id="accordion-collection-2780">
    <a class="accordion-link" id="accordion-link-2780" tabindex="0">Alles uitklappen</a>
  <div class="panel-group">
          
<div class="panel panel-default" id="collapse-2773-panel">
  <div class="panel-heading">
    <h3 class="panel-title">
      <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapse-2773" class="accordion-item expanded" title="Close this item">
        Banda-eilanden
      </a>
    </h3>
  </div>
  <div id="collapse-2773" class="panel-collapse collapse in">
    <div class="panel-body">
                <div class="field-field-contents paragraph-accordion__field-contents">
              <div class="field-field-contents-item paragraph-accordion__field-contents-item"><p class="MsoNormal">Heel lang zijn de Banda-eilanden het enige productiegebied van nootmuskaat en foelie ter wereld. Nootmuskaat is in de 17e eeuw één van de duurste specerijen. De kleine Banda-eilanden liggen ruim 2.500 km van Batavia vandaan.</p></div>
        </div>

                <div class="field-field-paragraphs paragraph-accordion__field-paragraphs">
              <div class="field-field-paragraphs-item paragraph-accordion__field-paragraphs-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--carousel paragraph--view-mode--default carousel slide" data-ride="carousel" id="carousel-2772" data-interval="false">
    <div class="carousel-inner" aria-labelledby="carousel-modal-2772">
